//! Cortex-R52 AArch32 system register accessors (coprocessor p15).
//!
//! Registers follow the order of sections 4.2.19 to 4.2.36 of the Cortex-R52
//! TRM (100026_0104_01). EL2/Hyp registers are not included. A register that
//! appears in several sections is only defined once, at its first occurrence.
//! Read-only registers only have `_get`, write-only ones only have `_set`.

